* Zoezi: Fibonacci closure

Hebu tufurahie kidogo vitendakazi.

Tekeleza kitendakazi cha `fibonacci` kinachorejesha kitendakazi (closure) ambacho
hurejesha [[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fibonacci_number][nambari za Fibonacci]] zinazofuatana
(0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, ...).

